{"id":"f71e8ee2e0f13d03","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-cook-reckhow-equivalence.md","title":"Polynomially Bounded Systems and NP = coNP","display":"thm-cook-reckhow-equivalence — Polynomially Bounded Systems and NP = coNP","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-cook-reckhow-equivalence","aliases":["72-thm-cook-reckhow-equivalence"],"display":"thm-cook-reckhow-equivalence — Polynomially Bounded Systems and NP = coNP","depends_on":["[[72-df-propositional-proof-system]]","[[72-df-polynomial-proof]]"],"source_location":"Pudlak, Chapter VIII, Theorem 2.1.1; printed p. 550; PDF p. 562","source_statement_status":"source-statement-compared","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_status":"Both certificate conversions checked; Cook-Levin/coNP completeness taken as standard external theorem","round2_verification_status":"local-proof-checked-with-declared-standard-background","verification_status":"local-proof-checked-with-declared-standard-background"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-cook-reckhow-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-cook-reckhow-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-cook-reckhow-equivalence — Polynomially Bounded Systems and NP = coNP"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" href=\"?note=d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" title=\"72-df-propositional-proof-system\">72-df-propositional-proof-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b7212f0a8db1c2a3\" href=\"?note=b7212f0a8db1c2a3\" title=\"72-df-polynomial-proof\">72-df-polynomial-proof</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Pudlak, Chapter VIII, Theorem 2.1.1; printed p. 550; PDF p. 562"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"source-statement-compared"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"Both certificate conversions checked; Cook-Levin/coNP completeness taken as standard external theorem"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"local-proof-checked-with-declared-standard-background"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-proof-checked-with-declared-standard-background"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}\">\\(\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" href=\"?note=d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" title=\"72-df-propositional-proof-system\">72-df-propositional-proof-system</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PolyBounded}\">\\(\\operatorname{PolyBounded}\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b7212f0a8db1c2a3\" href=\"?note=b7212f0a8db1c2a3\" title=\"72-df-polynomial-proof\">72-df-polynomial-proof</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NP}\">\\(\\mathbf{NP}\\)</span> 为非确定型图灵机多项式时间可判定的二进制语言全体，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{coNP}=\\{\\Sigma^*\\setminus L:L\\in\\mathbf{NP}\\}\">\\(\\mathbf{coNP}=\\{\\Sigma^*\\setminus L:L\\in\\mathbf{NP}\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TAUT}\">\\(\\mathrm{TAUT}\\)</span> 使用有限完备联结词基和通常可多项式解析的公式编码。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\exists P:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*\\;\n(\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(P)\\land\\operatorname{PolyBounded}(P))\\bigr)\n\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\mathbf{NP}=\\mathbf{coNP}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\exists P:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*\\;\n(\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(P)\\land\\operatorname{PolyBounded}(P))\\bigr)\n\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\mathbf{NP}=\\mathbf{coNP}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>来源：Chapter VIII，Theorem 2.1.1（Cook and Reckhow [1979]），印刷页 550，PDF 页 562；本次逐项核对了定理陈述。</li>\n<li>本地复核了标准论证：多项式长证书把 TAUT 放入 NP，配合 TAUT 的 coNP 完全性推出两个类相等。反向用 TAUT 的 NP 验证关系构造总的 Cook–Reckhow 函数；非法证书输出固定重言式，合法输入包含公式及证书，因而仍给出多项式长证明。</li>\n<li>原书把 coNP 完全性作为已知事实并称本定理为直接推论；本次没有重新证明 Cook–Levin 完全性定理，也没有机器形式化复杂性类。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-propositional-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-propositional-proof-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-polynomial-proof","status":"resolved","id":"b7212f0a8db1c2a3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-polynomial-proof]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}$ 如 [[72-df-propositional-proof-system]]；$\\operatorname{PolyBounded}$ 如 [[72-df-polynomial-proof]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-polynomial-proof","status":"resolved","id":"b7212f0a8db1c2a3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}$ 如 [[72-df-propositional-proof-system]]；$\\operatorname{PolyBounded}$ 如 [[72-df-polynomial-proof]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PolyBounded}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{NP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{coNP}=\\{\\Sigma^*\\setminus L:L\\in\\mathbf{NP}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TAUT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigl(\\exists P:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*\\;\n(\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(P)\\land\\operatorname{PolyBounded}(P))\\bigr)\n\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\mathbf{NP}=\\mathbf{coNP}.","display":true}],"bytes":2111,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-350","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-cook-reckhow-equivalence|thm-cook-reckhow-equivalence — Polynomially Bounded Systems and NP = coNP]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-348","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[thm-cook-reckhow-equivalence — Polynomially Bounded Systems and NP = coNP](72-thm-cook-reckhow-equivalence.md)"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-376","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-thm-cook-reckhow-equivalence|thm-cook-reckhow-equivalence — Polynomially Bounded Systems and NP = coNP]]"},{"id":"9269f9c4fc3715b6","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf{NP},\\mathbf{coNP}$ 及有限完备基编码条件如 [[72-thm-cook-reckhow-equivalence]]；$\\omega$ 为含 $0$ 的自然数集合。"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-429","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-thm-cook-reckhow-equivalence]]"}],"outgoing":["d9d13f2ac55f5a6d","b7212f0a8db1c2a3"]}